<item><title>DR Congo plans $500 million water programme for four provinces</title><link>https://africanstreetjournal.com/cd/dr-congo-plans-500-million-water-programme-for-four-b281cb/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://africanstreetjournal.com/cd/dr-congo-plans-500-million-water-programme-for-four-b281cb/</guid><category>DR Congo</category><description>The second phase of the national water and sanitation programme targets 5 million people across Kongo Central, Haut-Katanga, Lualaba and a fourth province.</description><pubDate>Fri, 20 Nov 2026 06:57:56 GMT</pubDate><enclosure url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/cd.jpg" length="34755" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/cd.jpg" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1200" height="630"/></item>
<item><title>Medical charity urges wider use of Ebola vaccine in DR Congo</title><link>https://africanstreetjournal.com/cd/medical-charity-urges-wider-use-of-ebola-vaccine-in-dr-congo-150d06/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://africanstreetjournal.com/cd/medical-charity-urges-wider-use-of-ebola-vaccine-in-dr-congo-150d06/</guid><category>DR Congo</category><description>Médecins Sans Frontières, known as MSF, wants access to the ERVEBO vaccine expanded quickly rather than waiting for a different vaccine.</description><pubDate>Fri, 20 Nov 2026 05:23:00 GMT</pubDate><enclosure url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/cd.jpg" length="34755" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/cd.jpg" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1200" height="630"/></item>
<item><title>DR Congo certifies 153.951.330,09 USD in third-quarter oil claims</title><link>https://africanstreetjournal.com/cd/dr-congo-certifies-153-951-330-09-usd-in-third-quarter-oil-30ed94/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://africanstreetjournal.com/cd/dr-congo-certifies-153-951-330-09-usd-in-third-quarter-oil-30ed94/</guid><category>DR Congo</category><description>The Government says it will pay the certified claims and provide fourth-quarter advances as it keeps pump prices stable amid rising world oil prices.</description><pubDate>Fri, 20 Nov 2026 05:06:20 GMT</pubDate><enclosure url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/cd/dr-congo-certifies-153-951-330-09-usd-in-third-quarter-oil-30ed94/share.jpg" length="41225" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/cd/dr-congo-certifies-153-951-330-09-usd-in-third-quarter-oil-30ed94/share.jpg" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1200" height="630"/></item>
<item><title>Wooden-barge owners urge Congo ministry to suspend river ban</title><link>https://africanstreetjournal.com/cd/wooden-barge-owners-urge-congo-ministry-to-suspend-river-ban-f6d2ba/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://africanstreetjournal.com/cd/wooden-barge-owners-urge-congo-ministry-to-suspend-river-ban-f6d2ba/</guid><category>DR Congo</category><description>Owners in Kinshasa want each vessel inspected and upgraded gradually, warning that a blanket ban could cost jobs and disrupt riverside supplies.</description><pubDate>Thu, 19 Nov 2026 19:20:37 GMT</pubDate><enclosure url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/cd.jpg" length="34755" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/cd.jpg" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1200" height="630"/></item>
<item><title>UN human rights office records 1 843 victims in DR Congo</title><link>https://africanstreetjournal.com/cd/un-human-rights-office-records-1-843-victims-in-dr-congo-80617d/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://africanstreetjournal.com/cd/un-human-rights-office-records-1-843-victims-in-dr-congo-80617d/</guid><category>DR Congo</category><description>Its September count rose by more than 41 % from August, with conflict-affected provinces accounting for 91 % of documented violations.</description><pubDate>Thu, 19 Nov 2026 04:38:22 GMT</pubDate><enclosure url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/cd.jpg" length="34755" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/cd.jpg" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1200" height="630"/></item>
